WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.174
Pocket is gone. Now what?

2
00:00:01.274 --> 00:00:03.613
Save any page with one click, with a summary

3
00:00:03.613 --> 00:00:03.994
on top.

4
00:00:03.994 --> 00:00:06.111
Your library has tags and search, and sends

5
00:00:06.111 --> 00:00:06.796
to your Kindle.

6
00:00:06.796 --> 00:00:08.630
Free, and it all stays on your device.
